Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 16:10:21 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] J714s release 3: kernel v272-4 (the 27.2 AOP) and firmware
 j714s9

Re-pinned from betizzel/omarchy-m5 ac63a3d: linux-aurora 7.3.0.aurora17.v272-4
(964cd9a3..., 44136582 bytes: Jens Axboe's aurora-silicon/linux #1645, which
starts every AFK endpoint the 27.2 AOP firmware advertises, so the sound
cards, microphones and AOP sensors come up) and omarchy-aurora-firmware
20261014.j714s9 (8170bde1..., 48022 bytes: loads aop at boot on the J714s).
The qualification pins follow 7.3.0-17.v272-4-ARCH. Set
j714s-dev-runtime-7cd4572ff7ef.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
